SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia at Mersinia
LOCATION:Mersinia\, Ios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The chapel of the Virgin at Mersinia\, in the countryside north of Chora\, holds its own feast on 21 August with a vespers the evening before\, food and wine offered by the families who look after the church\, and music. A small rural panigiri\; ask in Chora for directions and a lift.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ios/#mersinia-panigiri-of-panagia-at-mersinia
